| RunAll - run every variant and spool all output to <RoTest$Dir>.Results
| The first EABI program that runs makes SharedLibs run its own Obey files, which changes <Obey$Dir>,
| so remember our directory in a private variable BEFORE running anything.
| (If a program stops with an error this script stops too: type *Spool to close the results file,
|  then run the remaining variants one at a time, e.g.  *Run <RoTest$Dir>.g16-O2 )
Set RoTest$Dir <Obey$Dir>
Spool <RoTest$Dir>.Results
Echo ===================== cx10-O0
Run <RoTest$Dir>.cx10-O0
Echo ===================== cx10-O2
Run <RoTest$Dir>.cx10-O2
Echo ===================== cx16-O0
Run <RoTest$Dir>.cx16-O0
Echo ===================== cx16-O2
Run <RoTest$Dir>.cx16-O2
Echo ===================== cx16-O3
Run <RoTest$Dir>.cx16-O3
Echo ===================== cx16-O2p
Run <RoTest$Dir>.cx16-O2p
Echo ===================== cx16-20
Run <RoTest$Dir>.cx16-20
Echo ===================== cx16-23
Run <RoTest$Dir>.cx16-23
Echo ===================== cx23
Run <RoTest$Dir>.cx23
Spool
Echo Finished. Output is in <RoTest$Dir>.Results
